BT 1 0 0 1 0 57 Tm /F4 11 Tf 17 TL 3.986145 Tw (Cybersecurity is the practice of protecting systems, networks, applications, and information from) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.222969 Tw (unauthorised access, misuse, disruption, or damage. A common source of evidence during a security) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.832199 Tw (investigation is a web activity log, which records events such as authentication attempts, requested) Tj T* 0 Tw (resources, API calls, timestamps, and client IP addresses.) Tj T* ET
