BT 1 0 0 1 0 57 Tm /F4 11 Tf 17 TL 1.458706 Tw (Web activity logs provide a time-ordered record of requests made to an application. Depending on the) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.604542 Tw (logging configuration, an entry may include a timestamp, source IP address, user or session identifier,) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.386899 Tw (requested path, HTTP method, status code, and response outcome. Investigators can use these fields to) Tj T* 0 Tw (reconstruct a sequence of activity and identify deviations from expected behaviour.) Tj T* ET
