BT 1 0 0 1 0 74 Tm /F4 11 Tf 17 TL -0.057416 Tw (Potential indicators include repeated requests at exact intervals, high request volume, unusual access times,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.530122 Tw (requests made without the page resources normally loaded by a browser, and repeated unauthorised) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.685966 Tw (responses. These signals are not conclusive on their own. Automated monitoring, scheduled scripts,) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.077299 Tw (misconfigured applications, or legitimate integrations can also create repetitive traffic, so context and) Tj T* 0 Tw (corroborating evidence are important.) Tj T* ET
